[chara_part name="miyako" face="smile"]
[app name="miyako" pos="3" time="600" wait="true"]
[talk name="miyako" face="smile"]
哇，这里就是山海经，真气派啊……
[click_next]
[chara_part name="miyako" face="respond"]
[talk name="miyako" face="respond"]
不过街上人也太多了，大家跟紧一点，别走散了。
[click_next]
[hide_message_window]
[hide name="miyako" mode="def" time="600" wait="true"]
[chara_part name="moe" face="default"]
[app name="moe" pos="3" time="600" wait="true"]
[talk name="moe" face="default"]
