[click_next]
[hide_message_window]
[hide name="miyu" mode="def" time="600" wait="true"]
[chara_part name="saki" face="default"]
[app name="saki" pos="3" time="600" wait="true"]
[talk name="saki" face="default"]
别光顾着玩了，我们可是受到邀请过来参观的。
[click_next]
[chara_part name="saki" face="respond"]
[talk name="saki" face="respond"]
这里的一切都离不开完美的武装防护，竟然感受不到危险的气息，真是滴水不漏。
[click_next]
[hide_message_window]
[hide name="saki" mode="def" time="600" wait="true"]
[app name="miyu" pos="3" time="600" wait="true"]
[talk name="miyu"]
厕，厕……
[click_next]
[hide_message_window]
[hide name="miyu" mode="def" time="600" wait="true"]
[chara_part name="miyako" face="smile"]
[app name="miyako" pos="2" time="600" wait="true"]
[move name="miyako" pos="4" wait="true"]
[chara_part name="miyako" face="07"]
[emo name="miyako" emo="twinkle" wait="false"]
