[mask_off time="1000"]
[chara_part name="miyu" face="respond"]
[app name="miyu" pos="3" time="600" wait="true"]
[talk name="miyu" face="respond"]
……咦？大家人呢……？
[click_next]
[chara_part name="miyu" face="default"]
[talk name="miyu" face="default"]
没关系，这种时候……只要用桃信联系……
[click_next]
[hide_message_window]
[emo name="miyu" emo="exclaim" wait="true"]
[chara_part name="miyu" face="embarrass"]
[talk name="miyu" face="embarrass"]
诶？！没有信号……！怎，怎么会这样！
[click_next]
[talk name="miyu"]
难道说，又被忘记了吗……
[click_next]
[chara_part name="miyu" face="07"]
[talk name="miyu" face="07"]
也是呢，在这么热闹的街道上……确实有更多值得关注的东西吧……
[click_next]
[hide_message_window]
[hide name="miyu" mode="def" time="600" wait="true"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible="true"]
#老板
玄龙门的年货都已经装上运输车啦。
[click_next]
[chara_part name="mina" face="default"]
[app name="mina" pos="3" time="600" wait="true"]
[talk name="mina" face="default"]
有劳多费心了，门主很喜欢你们店里的年货。
[click_next]
[layopt layer="message0" visible="true"]
#老板
平日里多谢您照顾我们家的生意了！
[click_next]
[layopt layer="message0" visible="true"]
#老板
这里还有些散装的肉干坚果，就当是谢礼啦！
[click_next]
[chara_part name="mina" face="smile"]
[talk name="mina" face="smile"]
哎呀，这么客气干嘛呀。
[click_next]
[layopt layer="message0" visible="true"]
#老板
收下收下！就当祝我明年发财啦~
[click_next]
[chara_part name="mina" face="default"]
[talk name="mina" face="default"]
……
好。
[click_next]
[chara_part name="mina" face="smile"]
[talk name="mina" face="smile"]
那，明年见了，老板。新年快乐。
[click_next]
[chara_part name="mina" face="default"]
[talk name="mina" face="default"]
接下来……确认一下各个地区的情况吧。
[click_next]
[layopt layer="message0" visible="true"]
#
（南拿起特制的通讯设备……）
[click_next]
[chara_part name="mina" face="default"]
[talk name="mina" face="default"]
……各地有无异常？
[click_next]
[layopt layer="message0" visible="true"]
#玄龙门成员A
报告队长，一切平安。
[click_next]
[layopt layer="message0" visible="true"]
#玄龙门成员B
报告队长，我们这里也无异常情况。
[click_next]
[chara_part name="mina" face="smile"]
[talk name="mina" face="smile"]
大过年的，各位辛苦，站好最后一班岗。
[click_next]
[layopt layer="message0" visible="true"]
#玄龙门成员A
是！
[click_next]
[layopt layer="message0" visible="true"]
#玄龙门成员B
是！新年快乐！队长！
[click_next]
[talk name="mina"]
嗯，新年快乐。
[click_next]
[layopt layer="message0" visible="true"]
#
（南挂断了通讯，在远处瞧见了一个陌生的身影。）
[click_next]
[chara_part name="mina" face="embarrassed"]
[talk name="mina" face="embarrassed"]
嗯？那边的人怎么鬼鬼祟祟的……
[click_next]
[hide_message_window]
[emo name="mina" emo="dot" wait="true"]
[chara_part name="mina" face="serious"]
[talk name="mina" face="serious"]
难道说……是间谍？！
[click_next]
[hide_message_window]
[hide name="mina" mode="def" time="600" wait="true"]
[app name="miyu" pos="3" time="600" wait="true"]
[talk name="miyu"]
我记得说过，如果走散了就在垃圾桶集合的来着……
[click_next]
[talk name="miyu"]
可是都过去这么久了，难道是别的垃圾桶吗……？
[click_next]
[hide_message_window]
[hide name="miyu" mode="def" time="600" wait="true"]
[chara_part name="mina" face="embarrassed"]
[app name="mina" pos="3" time="600" wait="true"]
[emo name="mina" emo="exclaim" wait="true"]
[talk name="mina" face="embarrassed"]
什么？集合？垃圾桶？
[click_next]
[chara_part name="mina" face="serious"]
[talk name="mina" face="serious"]
……！竟然选择这么隐蔽的地方接头吗？百密一疏啊。
[click_next]
[chara_part name="mina" face="embarrassed"]
[talk name="mina" face="embarrassed"]
嗯？一眨眼就不见了？
[click_next]
[hide_message_window]
[move name="mina" pos="2" wait="true"]
[chara_part name="mina" face="13"]
[talk name="mina" face="13"]
……在身后吗！！！
[click_next]
[chara_part name="miyu" face="07"]
[app name="miyu" pos="4" time="600" wait="true"]
[talk name="miyu" face="07"]
